# Python lint and types

Config is in the root `pyproject.toml`. Hooks are in `.pre-commit-config.yaml`.

- Format and lint with ruff. Typecheck with mypy.
- Use the project interpreter: `.venv/bin/python`.
- Before finishing a Python change, run `.venv/bin/pre-commit run --all-files` from the repo root.
- Fix new ruff and mypy errors in the changed code. Do not silence them with a blanket ignore.

```bash
.venv/bin/ruff check --fix services/api
.venv/bin/ruff format services/api
.venv/bin/mypy
```
